stateDiagram-v2
    %% Lifecycle credential continuations use fixed ID horizons and advance past
    %% retained rows. Each batch reconciles claims and delivers source audits before
    %% dependency-gated collection; cursors confer no deletion authority.
    %% CURRENT implementation; sources and guards in transition inventory.
    state "unconfirmed candidate (derived)" as candidate
    state "available_at? true (derived)" as available
    state "claimed_at and durable flow binding present (derived)" as claimed
    state "consumed_at and successful receipt present (derived)" as consumed
    state "revoked_at present (derived)" as revoked
    state "discard_at <= clock (derived)" as discarded
    state "credential physically deleted" as purged
    [*] --> candidate
    candidate --> available: commit_storage_confirmation!
    candidate --> discarded: verified Client withdrawal with source audit
    available --> discarded: verified Client withdrawal with revocation and source audit
    claimed --> claimed: withdrawal revocation retains live continuation proof
    available --> revoked: commit_management_revocation!
    available --> claimed: commit_sign_in_claim! with durable local or app OIDC binding
    claimed --> consumed: matching canonical Ticket receipt
    claimed --> discarded: verified canceled / expired / failed flow and browser binding
    consumed --> discarded: same source retirement transaction
    candidate --> discarded: issuance cancel/expiry invalidator
    revoked --> [*]
    discarded --> purged: retention and holds permit; credential Chronicle acknowledgment (allocation also for candidates); atomic DELETE plus surviving purged outbox
    purged --> [*]
    note right of candidate
        No status_id FK in current app Secret model.
        Claim is irreversible even when later login fails.
        Unknown outcomes remain claimed until reconciled.
        Ticket rollback cannot release a source claim.
        Terminal ownership repair grants no login evidence.
        Signup lookup remains gated until signup completion.
        Legacy generic Secret APIs/tests are not current edges.
    end note
